{"status": 200, "url": "https://www.mainau.de/en", "body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n<html dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\" prefix=\"og: https://ogp.me/ns#\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n<noscript>\n</noscript>\n<meta content=\"Visit Island Mainau in Germany in Lake Constance and explore stunning gardens, historic parks and unforgettable nature all year round.\" name=\"description\"/>\n<meta content=\"Discover Island Mainau in Germany on Lake Constance – famous for its gardens, flowers, parks and year‑round nature experiences.\" name=\"abstract\"/>\n<link href=\"https://www.mainau.de/en\" rel=\"canonical\"/>\n<link href=\"https://www.mainau.de/en\" rel=\"shortlink\"/>\n<link href=\"https://www.mainau.de/sites/default/files/styles/social_media/public/2024-12/luftaufnahme-inselmainau-winter.jpg.webp?h=9eb0d413&amp;itok=XoWTy6We\" rel=\"image_src\"/>\n<meta content=\"Insel Mainau\" property=\"og:site_name\"/>\n<meta content=\"https://www.mainau.de/en/startpage\" property=\"og:url\"/>\n<meta content=\"Home\" property=\"og:title\"/>\n<meta content=\"The quick, brown fox jumps over a lazy dog. DJs flock by when MTV ax quiz prog. Junk MTV quiz graced by fox whelps. Bawds jog, flick quartz, vex nymphs. Waltz, bad nymph, for quick jigs vex! Fox nymphs grab quick-jived waltz. Brick quiz whangs jumpy veldt fox.\" property=\"og:description\"/>\n<meta content=\"https://www.mainau.de/sites/default/files/styles/social_media/public/2024-12/luftaufnahme-inselmainau-winter.jpg.webp?h=9eb0d413&amp;itok=XoWTy6We\" property=\"og:image\"/>\n<meta content=\"1200\" property=\"og:image:width\"/>\n<meta content=\"675\" property=\"og:image:height\"/>\n<meta content=\"The quick, brown fox jumps over a lazy dog. DJs flock by when MTV ax quiz prog. Junk MTV quiz graced by fox whelps. Bawds jog, flick quartz, vex nymphs. Waltz, bad nymph, for quick jigs vex! Fox nymphs grab quick-jived waltz. Brick quiz whangs jumpy veldt fox.\" name=\"twitter:description\"/>\n<meta content=\"Home | Insel Mainau\" name=