rawer>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header>\n<div>\n<div class=\"hidden\" data-drupal-messages-fallback=\"\"></div>\n</div>\n<main class=\"mb-auto\" role=\"main\">\n<a id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>\n<section class=\"layout-content relative\">\n<qz-box id=\"block-volcano-header-sections\">\n<div region=\"content\">\n<div>\n<qz-section class=\"paragraph paragraph--image widget--avaiable\" spacing=\"bottom-none top-none\" width=\"wide\">\n<qz-media brightness=\"dark\" variant=\"hero\" widget=\"\">\n<article class=\"relative\">\n<img alt=\"Luftaufnahme von der Insel Mainau im Herbst. Im Hintergrund ist die umgebende Landschaft sowie Nebelfelder zu sehen sowie die Herbstfärbung der Bäume\" class=\"lazyload\" data-sizes=\"auto\" data-src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/hero_extra_large/public/2025-09/luftaufnahme-mainau-herbst-mende.jpg.webp?h=a05dec19&amp;itok=BaRrh-lh\" data-srcset=\"/sites/default/files/styles/hero_placeholder/public/2025-09/luftaufnahme-mainau-herbst-mende.jpg.webp?h=a05dec19&amp;itok=o2PMvqn8 21w, /sites/default/files/styles/hero_small/public/2025-09/luftaufnahme-mainau-herbst-mende.jpg.webp?h=a05dec19&amp;itok=xJ8Yr7Fe 483w, /sites/default/files/styles/hero_medium/public/2025-09/luftaufnahme-mainau-herbst-mende.jpg.webp?h=a05dec19&amp;itok=Zh9fbcVW 777w, /sites/default/files/styles/hero_large/public/2025-09/luftaufnahme-mainau-herbst-mende.jpg.webp?h=a05dec19&amp;itok=86iediJU 1050w, /sites/default/files/styles/hero_extra_large/public/2025-09/luftaufnahme-mainau-herbst-mende.jpg.webp?h=a05dec19&amp;itok=BaRrh-lh 1470w, /sites/default/files/styles/hero_full/public/2025-09/luftaufnahme-mainau-herbst-mende.jpg.webp?h=a05dec19&amp;itok=uodPtp78 1932w, /sites/default/files/styles/hero_4k/public/2025-09/luftaufnahme-mainau-herbst-mende.jpg.webp?h=a05dec19&amp;itok=Ulki2Igj 3864w\" height=\"700\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRpgAAABXRUJQVlA4IIwAAACQBACdASoVAAoAPm0skkWkIqGYBABABsSzAE6Xr3wBlf4EBeJ3IqYHVXlLvgAA/qN8Em8aBh6sMm3be3tktE+eobdzyR+1cdD91xo02T5iYZdySx2nwJdAzIP7FEIisqhe8g8nCEYJpdd8FWVc6cvF3vtBgbawxfduwHa49r+CtKDVrsF+Sv2/5YAAAA==\" title=\"Insel Mainau im Herbst\" width=\"1470\"/>\n<div class=\"copyright\">\n<span class=\"text-gray-medium\">©</span>\n<div class=\"text-gray-medium inline text-xs\">Insel Mainau / Achim Mende</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n<span slot=\"text\"><h2> </h2><h2> </h2><h2> </h2><h1>Welcome to<br/>the island of Mainau</h1><p><span>Experience nature again and again, enjoy the uniqueness of every season</span><br/><span>and let your mind wander:</span></p><p><a class=\"link-button--primary\" href=\"/discover\">Discover mainau</a></p></span>\n<span slot=\"caption\"></span>\n<span slot=\"caption-long\"></span>\n<span slot=\"widgets\"><div class=\"flex items-end md:-bottom-8 gap-5 justify-end relative z-20\">\n<qz-widget link=\"https://webshop.mainau.de/de/tagestickets\" targetattr=\"_blank\">\n<div slot=\"start\">Tickets</div>\n<div slot=\"\"><qz-icon height=\"50\" name=\"ticket\"></qz-icon></div>\n<div slot=\"end\">Booking</div>\n</qz-widget>\n</div>\n</span>\n</qz-media>\n</qz-section>\n</div>\n</div>\n</qz-box>\n<article>\n<qz-section class=\"paragraph paragraph--headline qz-local-menu-content\" spacing=\"bottom-none top-small\" width=\"content\">\n<div class=\"text-center\">\n<h2 class=\"text-center\">\n<span slot=\"headline\">Discover Mainau Island</span>\n</h2>\n</div>\n</qz-section>\n<qz-section class=\"paragraph paragraph--page-reference qz-local-menu-content\" spacing=\"bottom-small top-small\" theme=\"light\" width=\"content\">\n<div class=\"relative pb-[5rem] lg:pb-0\">\n<div class=\"content-slider swiper\" data-slides-per-view=\"3\">\n<div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<qz-card animate-brighter=\"\" date=\"20.03.2026 - 02.11.2026\" has-action=\"\" label=\"Dinosaurs on Mainau Island\">\n<div slot=\"media\"><article>\n<img alt=\"Nahaufnahme eines reptilienartigen Auges, das zwischen dichten grünen Farnblättern hervorschaut\"