mg alt=\"Lächelndes Kind blickt zwischen hohen grünen Maispflanzen hervor und hält ein Blatt zur Seite\" class=\"lazyload\" data-sizes=\"auto\" data-src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/landscape_small/public/2026-05/maislabyrinth-shutterstock-mariana-serdynska.jpg.webp?h=2e3eca71&amp;itok=yv6MYorh\" data-srcset=\"/sites/default/files/styles/landscape_placeholder/public/2026-05/maislabyrinth-shutterstock-mariana-serdynska.jpg.webp?h=2e3eca71&amp;itok=x8lrdKcs 10w, /sites/default/files/styles/landscape_small/public/2026-05/maislabyrinth-shutterstock-mariana-serdynska.jpg.webp?h=2e3eca71&amp;itok=yv6MYorh 480w, /sites/default/files/styles/landscape_medium/public/2026-05/maislabyrinth-shutterstock-mariana-serdynska.jpg.webp?h=2e3eca71&amp;itok=L8gCiQ5b 768w, /sites/default/files/styles/landscape_large/public/2026-05/maislabyrinth-shutterstock-mariana-serdynska.jpg.webp?h=2e3eca71&amp;itok=42vyeLCw 1024w, /sites/default/files/styles/landscape_extra_large/public/2026-05/maislabyrinth-shutterstock-mariana-serdynska.jpg.webp?h=2e3eca71&amp;itok=QTup1J9k 1440w, /sites/default/files/styles/landscape_full/public/2026-05/maislabyrinth-shutterstock-mariana-serdynska.jpg.webp?h=2e3eca71&amp;itok=MFiSKY5F 1920w, /sites/default/files/styles/landscape_4k/public/2026-05/maislabyrinth-shutterstock-mariana-serdynska.jpg.webp?h=2e3eca71&amp;itok=QVZWWuCx 3840w\" height=\"360\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"data:image/webp;base64,UklGRn4AAABXRUJQVlA4IHIAAAAwAgCdASoKAAgAAUAmJZgCdBOAA2GAsmmp4AD+9fgaJdw2Zd3sXjviQkVB3T6+3aj4IzsDtgpTbGQiPWYWdXx1e4v9IO1l3Y3kYlr33SIJfmPhdoJPEG4nyW/I8xV1R5Yd06Xvxoy74f08s6bIGwdQAAA=\" title=\"Maislabyrinth auf der Insel Mainau\" width=\"480\"/>\n<div class=\"copyright\">\n<span class=\"text-gray-medium\">©</span>\n<div class=\"text-gray-medium inline text-xs\">Mariana Serdynska / Shutterstock.com</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n</div>\n<p>The maze, which covers about 1 hectare, features winding paths and a scavenger hunt for the whole family.</p>\n<qz-link animated=\"\" href=